PackageName: WeatherAPI.com
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-WeatherAPI
PackageVersion: API service accessed 2026-08-21
PackageDownloadLocation: https://www.weatherapi.com/
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: NOASSERTION
PackageLicenseDeclared: NOASSERTION
PackageCopyrightText: NOASSERTION
PackageComment: Optional hosted weather service, not redistributed by MARS. MARS supplies no shared account or key; the installer must use their own WeatherAPI account to enable it. Use is governed by https://www.weatherapi.com/terms.aspx and https://www.weatherapi.com/privacy.aspx. The local Lab server sends the configured API key, selected date, latitude and longitude to the service over HTTPS, does not expose the key to the browser, and does not cache or persist weather responses. The selected date and coordinates remain in private local Lab state so that inputs can be restored.

